      <p>I’m Ishant. I grew up in Sonipat, Haryana, and studied mechanical engineering at NIT Kurukshetra.</p>
      <p>I found my way into product through analytics, experiments, and curiosity about how people use things. That’s taken me through Jar, Houseworks, co-founding Crework, and now PICKUP Coffee.</p>
      <p>I like taking an idea and turning it into something people can use. Sometimes that’s part of my <a href="/work">work</a>. Sometimes it becomes a <a href="/projects">small side project</a>.</p>
      <p>Outside of that, I read and occasionally write. You can browse my <a href="/notes/books">bookshelf</a>, read my <a href="/notes">notes</a>, or find me on <a href="https://ishant.substack.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Substack</a>.</p>
      <p>This is a small place for all of it.</p>
